Normalization provenance (flozi normalize_text)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The flozi-canonical text normalization in `raven_eval_core/flozi_wer.py`
(`normalize_flozi`) is ported from the `normalize_text` function published on
the `flozi00/asr-german-mixed-evals` HuggingFace dataset card. Credit to
Florian Zimmermeister (flozi00). The upstream dataset card declares no explicit
license for that snippet; it is ~25 lines of mechanical string transforms
(regex/transliteration/number-word handling) and is credited here in good faith.

